  "details": "I would like to be able to save 1-3 presets for instance settings for portals I'm dropping.\n\nI tend to always select the same settings often\n\n- Always the same group\n\n- Always the same instance type (Group Public)\n\n- Always the same features enabled (Drones, stickers, prints, etc)\n\n- Always the same queue setting\n\nAnd I use these same settings for a handful of different worlds. And I am very very often inviting people to certain worlds me and my friends have made.\n\nIf I could just save those settings as a preset so I can quick-drop a portal, and save repetitive setting, that'd be great.\n\nI could use maybe a second preset for when I am dropping a portal for a scheduled community event too. I always set them up the same basically.\n\nIt could either be a presets where when selected it applies to all portals I drop, or specific presets tied to specific worlds that exist, or a system that allows for both global and world-specific presets.",
